# What the Cowork .skill package EXCLUDES. Patterns are skill-relative, forward-slash,
# PowerShell -like globs.
#
# Phase 1 strategy: ship the SLIM Slide Vault so verbatim reuse works in Cowork, but
# keep the heavy originals + generated browser out. The package therefore ships:
#   layouts/reference-library/index.json      (tiny search index)
#   layouts/reference-library/entries/*.json  (full per-entry records: planFragment, facts)
#   layouts/reference-library/catalog.json    (scrubbed authored source / fallback)
#   layouts/reference-library/rendered.slim/* (slimmed verbatim renders, ~5.7 MB)
# and EXCLUDES the heavy originals + intermediates below.
layouts/reference-library/rendered/*
layouts/reference-library/assets/*
layouts/library-v9/library.html
assets/images/extracted/*
